{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113306","id":3055353010,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62HPyy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113306","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113306.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113306.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113306","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113306/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113306/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113306/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/819b69f2c1e0aac273d5d57c1a0903496f02fa1b","number":113306,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Editor: Fix infinite appending of docks without slots to config","user":{"login":"Eshaan-byte","id":146680427,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL4qaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146680427?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte","html_url":"https://github.com/Eshaan-byte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nFixes #113281\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a bug where docks without default slots were being infinitely appended to the editor layout config file.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n\r\nThe clearing loop at lines 574-601 only clears dock slots 0 through `DOCK_SLOT_MAX` (generating config keys `dock_1` through `dock_15`). However, docks without default slots use index `-1`, which corresponds to the config key `dock_0`. This key was never cleared, so closed docks kept getting appended infinitely on each save.\r\n\r\n## Changes Made\r\n\r\nAdded code after line 601 to explicitly clear the `dock_0` config key before saving closed docks, matching the behavior of regular dock slots.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nTested with the reproduction steps provided in the issue:\r\n1. Created a plugin with an `EditorDock` that has no default slot\r\n2. Enabled the plugin\r\n3. Pressed Ctrl+S multiple times\r\n4. Verified that `dock_0` in `.godot/editor/editor_layout.cfg` no longer accumulates duplicate entries\r\n\r\nThe fix ensures that the special `-1` slot is properly cleared on each save, preventing the infinite appending behavior.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://av